no\ classes\ that\ are\ annotated\ with\ @RestController\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ are\ annotated\ with\ @Entity,\ because\ controller\ nh\u1EADn\ v\u00E0\ tr\u1EA3\ DTO;\ \u0111\u1EC3\ entity\ l\u1ECDt\ ra\ API\ l\u00E0\ g\u1EAFn\ h\u00ECnh\ d\u1EA1ng\ b\u1EA3ng\ v\u00E0o\ h\u1EE3p\ \u0111\u1ED3ng\ c\u00F4ng\ khai=b0b36b9d-f385-4f0b-bc6b-8e0787c728f6
